### Secrets ###
# docker/compose.yaml requires docker/.env, which holds the database and Keycloak
# credentials. Nothing excluded it before, so a `git add -A` would have committed it.
# The committed sample stays tracked as the template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.sample
!.env.example

